              "text": "He promised that any man who could solve this mystery might choose one daughter to be his wife.",
              "audioStart": 26.875,
              "audioEnd": 31.488
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "Many young men tried to stay up outside the bedroom door.",
              "audioStart": 32.35,
              "audioEnd": 35.15
            },
            {
              "text": "They always fell fast down because they were very tired.",
              "audioStart": 36.013,
              "audioEnd": 38.925
            },
            {
              "text": "A strong soldier who had been fighting in wars heard about this difficult challenge.",
              "audioStart": 39.788,
              "audioEnd": 43.737
            },
            {
              "text": "He decided to try his luck.",
              "audioStart": 44.6,
              "audioEnd": 46.188
            },
            {
              "text": "On his way to the large house, an old woman gave him a special magic cover.",
              "audioStart": 47.05,
              "audioEnd": 51.15
            },
            {
              "text": "She told him that the cover would make him completely hidden whenever he wore it.",
              "audioStart": 52.013,
              "audioEnd": 55.65
            },
            {
              "text": "When the soldier arrived, the king welcomed him nicely.",
              "audioStart": 56.513,
              "audioEnd": 59.388
            },
            {
              "text": "The king gave him a comfortable room near the daughters.",
              "audioStart": 60.25,
              "audioEnd": 62.812
            },
            {
              "text": "At night, the oldest daughter brought him a cup of sweet wine.",
              "audioStart": 63.675,
              "audioEnd": 66.8
            },
            {
              "text": "The smart soldier did not drink the wine.",
              "audioStart": 67.662,
              "audioEnd": 69.713
            },
            {
              "text": "He pretended to fall fast down instead.",
              "audioStart": 70.575,
              "audioEnd": 72.812
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "Soon, the twelve daughters got up from bed.",
              "audioStart": 73.675,
              "audioEnd": 76.088
            },
            {
              "text": "They put on lovely clothes and laughed quietly.",
              "audioStart": 76.95,
              "audioEnd": 79.412
            },
            {
              "text": "The youngest daughter whispered that the soldier was sleeping deeply.",
              "audioStart": 80.275,
              "audioEnd": 83.3
            },
            {
              "text": "She said that he would never open his eyes.",
              "audioStart": 84.162,
              "audioEnd": 86.263
            },
            {
              "text": "They opened a secret door under their bed.",
              "audioStart": 87.125,
              "audioEnd": 89.188
            },
            {
              "text": "They walked down into the dark earth.",
              "audioStart": 90.05,
              "audioEnd": 91.763
            },
            {
              "text": "Wearing his magic cover, the soldier followed them closely down the hidden steps.",
              "audioStart": 92.625,
              "audioEnd": 96.775
            },
            {
              "text": "At one point, he touched a daughter dress by mistake.",
              "audioStart": 97.638,
              "audioEnd": 100.713
            },
            {
              "text": "This action made her sister feel quite worried.",
              "audioStart": 101.575,
              "audioEnd": 103.963
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "Soon they arrived at a wonderful forest.",
              "audioStart": 104.825,
              "audioEnd": 106.95
            },
            {
              "text": "All the leaves in this forest were made of silver and gold.",
              "audioStart": 107.812,
              "audioEnd": 110.6
            },
            {
              "text": "The soldier broke off a small silver branch to keep as physical evidence of their journey.",
              "audioStart": 111.463,
              "audioEnd": 115.713
            },
            {
              "text": "They continued walking until they reached a broad river.",
              "audioStart": 116.575,
              "audioEnd": 119.275
            },
            {
              "text": "Twelve rich men waited in boats by the river.",
              "audioStart": 120.138,
              "audioEnd": 122.463
            },
            {
              "text": "Each daughter got into a boat with one man.",
              "audioStart": 123.325,
              "audioEnd": 125.588
            },
            {
              "text": "They crossed the water to reach a brilliant castle.",
              "audioStart": 126.45,
              "audioEnd": 128.975
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "Inside the bright castle, beautiful music played while everyone danced happily all night long.",
              "audioStart": 129.838,
              "audioEnd": 134.963
            },
            {
              "text": "The daughters danced until their shoes were completely ruined by morning.",
              "audioStart": 135.825,
              "audioEnd": 139.363
            },
            {
              "text": "Before day, the men brought them back across the river.",
              "audioStart": 140.225,
              "audioEnd": 143.15
            },
            {
              "text": "The daughters ran quickly to their room.",
              "audioStart": 144.012,
              "audioEnd": 145.938
            },
            {
              "text": "The soldier followed them closely.",
              "audioStart": 146.8,
              "audioEnd": 148.512
            },
            {
              "text": "He got back into his bed just before they opened their eyes.",
              "audioStart": 149.375,
              "audioEnd": 152.463
            },
            {
              "text": "When the king questioned him the next morning, the soldier told him everything that he had seen.",
              "audioStart": 153.325,
              "audioEnd": 157.863
            },
            {
              "text": "He showed the king the silver branch and explained the secret ball.",
              "audioStart": 158.725,
              "audioEnd": 161.938
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "The king called his twelve daughters and asked them if the soldier was telling the truth.",
              "audioStart": 162.8,
              "audioEnd": 166.887
            },
            {
              "text": "Realizing that their secret plan was completely discovered, the daughters admitted everything.",
              "audioStart": 167.75,
              "audioEnd": 172.475
            },
            {
              "text": "The strong soldier chose the oldest daughter to be his lovely wife.",
              "audioStart": 173.338,
              "audioEnd": 176.65
            },
            {
              "text": "He became part of the royal family.",
              "audioStart": 177.512,
              "audioEnd": 179.45
            },
            {
              "text": "From that day on, everyone lived happily together in the great castle.",
              "audioStart": 180.312,
              "audioEnd": 184.05
            },
            {
              "text": "The king was very glad that the mystery was finally solved by the smart soldier.",
              "audioStart": 184.912,
              "audioEnd": 189.062
            },
            {
              "text": "The twelve daughters stopped going to the secret place every night.",
              "audioStart": 189.925,
              "audioEnd": 192.975
            },
            {
              "text": "Their shoes remained clean and new every single morning from then on.",
              "audioStart": 193.838,
              "audioEnd": 197.275
            },
            {
              "text": "Everyone in the country celebrated the wonderful marriage with great joy and music.",
              "audioStart": 198.137,
              "audioEnd": 202.287
            },
            {
              "text": "The king felt very proud because the problem was finally solved.",
              "audioStart": 203.15,
              "audioEnd": 206.5
            },
            {
              "text": "The soldier lived a long life with his wonderful wife.",
              "audioStart": 207.363,
              "audioEnd": 210.137
            },
            {
              "text": "They were happy every day in the royal house.",
              "audioStart": 211,
              "audioEnd": 213.188
            }
          ]
        }
